#
# Encoding scope: the MACE-Unary-PBE-0 model trained here on a new unary
# data set of 65 elements, with its test MAEs, and the pretrained universal
# models benchmarked (MACE-MATPES-PBE-0, MACE-OMAT-0, MatterSim-v1.0.0-5M,
# PET-OMat-M, PET-MAD 1.0.2). The benchmarks themselves (equilibrium
# volumes, bulk moduli, recovery score, pairwise ordering accuracy,
# instability) are not energy or force errors and are not encoded.

